{"c":[{"id":"d082cbb6d6679657","sum":"Stockroom: DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude plugin; engine in skills/sr-search/. WSL walker: one stale /mnt drive must not abort. Cursor Path lines use backslashes; markdown-it collapses \\. (.cursor). Dashboard JSON export = full session_detail.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a192d96d4c3ee4db","sum":"Stockroom: local DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude Code plugin; skills sr-search/semantic/query/dashboard/initialize, engine in skills/sr-search/. Cursor model enrich WSL walker: one stale /mnt drive letter must not abort the walk.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T002308Z-d6e8a2c22f8985c0","text":"Stockroom: local DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude Code plugin; skills sr-search/sr-semantic/sr-query/sr-dashboard/sr-initialize; engine in skills/sr-search/","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T005853Z-6a18e7ec63e59a25","text":"Cursor model enrich WSL walker lists /mnt names then stats each child; one stale drive letter must not abort the walk.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0a2c3d2fdf7f0057","sum":"Cursor skill Path lines use Windows backslashes; markdown-it collapses \\. so .cursor glues to the parent dir. Dashboard JSON export serializes full session_detail, so API payload additions change exported JSON unless filtered.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T134339Z-d618aad7ad08508d","text":"Cursor skill Path lines use Windows backslashes; warehouse keeps \\.cursor; dashboard markdown-it collapses \\. so .cursor glues to the parent dir.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T134816Z-efbe5193e7203f0e","text":"Dashboard JSON export serializes full session_detail; API payload additions automatically change exported JSON unless filtered.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ea5c9d2bd405c3e0","sum":"Session view: bindSessionMarkdown disables CommonMark escapes so \\.cursor paths render; subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line never guess a turn: Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor only aligned zip or unique agent_type, rest omitted; JSON keeps subagents/parent_spawn.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"2464ad6d4d98dee3","sum":"Session markdown-it disables CommonMark escapes (bindSessionMarkdown) so \\.cursor paths render; dashboard subagent pills omit unmatched Claude spawn ids, JSON export keeps messages[].subagents and parent_spawn, and leftover is Cursor-only (needs parent message ordinals).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T135929Z-b16be49ee4a5a309","text":"Session-body markdown-it disables CommonMark escape via bindSessionMarkdown so \\.cursor and other hidden-dot paths survive render.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T140109Z-ffeba3eb9433dbab","text":"Dashboard subagent pills: Claude unmatched spawn ids omitted (no leftover); JSON export keeps messages[].subagents and parent_spawn; leftover is Cursor-only and needs parent message ordinals.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b5e01e46143d148c","sum":"Dashboard session view shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line, never guessing a turn: Claude joins spawn ids; Cursor places only an aligned zip (count + agent_type==subagent_type) or a unique agent_type; holes/extras omitted; unknown harness: none.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T154745Z-a99acf23a825f6a2","text":"Dashboard subagent pills: never guess a turn. Cursor leftover gone. Place only aligned zip (count + agent_type==subagent_type) or unique agent_type. Omit holes/extras. Unknown harness empty.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T161338Z-78459a311c0536ae","text":"Dashboard session view now shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor places only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
